        "IT/Admin"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "6c10f9ca-d188-4747-a7e2-f99f2de720b5",
      "content": "Company Values\n\nNorthstar's operating values are clarity, ownership, evidence, and trust. Employees should make decisions with evidence, document important work, and raise risks early. Teams are expected to treat internal policies as source-of-truth guidance rather than informal suggestions.",
